{
  "title": "Search Engine API — Audit & Performance",
  "description": "Created via Cloudflare Logpush → Datadog. Monitors auth/rate-limit security events, backend performance, and SLO compliance.",
  "layout_type": "free",
  "notify_list": [],
  "tags": ["service:ssak-search", "source:cloudflare", "monitoring:logpush"],
  "template_variables": [
    {
      "name": "service",
      "prefix": "service",
      "default": "ssak-search"
    },
    {
      "name": "env",
      "prefix": "ddEnv",
      "default": "production"
    },
    {
      "name": "severity",
      "prefix": "severity",
      "default": "*"
    }
  ],
  "widgets": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "# Search Engine API — Audit & Operations Dashboard\n\nThis dashboard visualizes security audit events streamed via **Cloudflare Logpush → Datadog Logs Ingestion**.\n\n**Data Source:** `source:cloudflare service:ssak-search`\n\n**Audit Events:** `@audit:\"true\"` | **Critical Alerts:** `@severity:\"critical\"`\n\n---",
        "background_color": "transparent",
        "font_size": "14",
        "text_align": "left",
        "show_tick": false,
        "tick_pos": "50%",
        "tick_edge": "left"
      },
      "layout": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "width": 12, "height": 4 }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "definition": {
        "title": "Total Audit Events (24h)",
        "title_size": "16",
        "title_align": "left",
        "type": "query_value",
        "requests": [
          {
            "formulas": [{ "formula": "query1" }],
            "queries": [
              {
                "name": "query1",
                "data_source": "logs",
                "query": "source:cloudflare service:$service @audit:\"true\"",
                "indexes": ["*"],
                "compute": { "aggregation": "count" }
              }
            ],
            "response_format": "scalar"
          }
        ],
        "autoscale": true,
        "precision": 0
      },
      "layout": { "x": 0, "y": 4, "width": 3, "height": 2 }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "definition": {
        "title": "Critical Events (24h)",
        "title_size": "16",
        "title_align": "left",
        "type": "query_value",
        "requests": [
          {
            "formulas": [{ "formula": "query1" }],
            "queries": [
              {
                "name": "query1",
                "data_source": "logs",
                "query": "source:cloudflare service:$service @audit:\"true\" @severity:\"critical\"",
                "indexes": ["*"],
                "compute": { "aggregation": "count" }
              }
            ],
            "response_format": "scalar"
          }
        ],
        "autoscale": true,
        "precision": 0,
        "custom_links": [
          { "label": "View Critical Events", "link": "/logs?query=source%3Acloudflare%20service%3Assak-search%20%40audit%3A%22true%22%20%40severity%3A%22critical%22&cols=%5B%22timestamp%22%2C%22message%22%2C%22auditEventType%22%2C%22actor%22" }
        ]
      },
      "layout": { "x": 3, "y": 4, "width": 3, "height": 2 }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "definition": {
        "title": "Auth Failures (24h)",
        "title_size": "16",
        "title_align": "left",
        "type": "query_value",
        "requests": [
          {
            "formulas": [{ "formula": "query1" }],
            "queries": [
              {
                "name": "query1",
                "data_source": "logs",
                "query": "source:cloudflare service:$service @audit:\"true\" @eventType:\"auth_failure\"",
                "indexes": ["*"],
                "compute": { "aggregation": "count" }
              }
            ],
            "response_format": "scalar"
          }
        ],
        "autoscale": true,
        "precision": 0,
        "custom_links": [
          { "label": "View Auth Failures", "link": "/logs?query=source%3Acloudflare%20service%3Assak-search%20%40audit%3A%22true%22%20%40eventType%3A%22auth_failure%22" }
        ]
      },
      "layout": { "x": 6, "y": 4, "width": 3, "height": 2 }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "definition": {
